WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Simulation only. A scripted person box enters Bench A, with a four-second dwell rule.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Sustained entry creates a review flag. This is not live camera evidence or a danger verdict.

00:09.000 --> 00:18.000
Read the simulated zone observation. Position is measured in the image, not real-world depth.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
In Events, open the zone observation and record a human outcome separately.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Mark reviewed. Resolution requires a separate human confirmation; leaving the zone never resolves a flag.
